{"id":"00417","root":"uni00417_1","name":{"ja":"熱川　るみ","en":"Atagawa Rumi"},"title":{"ja":"【お手伝い巫女さん】","en":"【Helping Shrine Maiden】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【お手伝い巫女さん】 熱川　るみ","en":"【Helping Shrine Maiden】 Atagawa Rumi"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-12-31","limited":true,"characterId":208,"profile":{"ja":"学生対魔忍。超高温の水蒸気を操る忍法を使う。母譲りの水遁の術使いであるが、高温を出せることには父が火遁使いであることが関係しているのではないかと言われる。特殊な水鉄砲から蒸気圧による高圧水流を放って敵を攻撃し、五車学園内でも前線で戦えるアタッカー候補として大いに期待されている。性格は明るく前向きで、少し子供っぽいものの、対魔忍としての努めを果たせる様になろうと日夜頑張る努力家。だが、非常に恥ずかしがり屋かつ上がり症なので、注目されたり褒められたりする事は苦手。緊張や羞恥が高まると頭から蒸気を噴いてしまう体質を嫌がっているが、友人たちからは「可愛い」と言われて評判は悪くない。友人に頼まれ、お正月の神社の手伝いをすることになったるみ。本人は上がり症を治すいい機会だと思って頑張るが、巫女さん姿で注目されると、やっぱり恥ずかしさから蒸気を噴き出してしまう。上がり症の克服はまだできそうにない。","en":"She is a student Taimanin who uses a ninja art that manipulates super-high-temperature steam. She inherited water-style techniques from her mother, and it's rumored that her father's fire-style abilities enable her to generate such high temperatures. She fires high-pressure water streams generated by steam pressure from a special water gun, making her a promising frontline attacker at Gosha Academy. Her personality is bright and optimistic; she's a bit childlike but works tirelessly day and night to fulfill her duties as a Taimanin. However, she's extremely shy and suffers from stage fright, so she dislikes being the center of attention or receiving praise. When her nerves or embarrassment spike, she involuntarily erupts steam from her head - a trait she loathes, though friends call her \"cute,\" keeping her reputation solid."},"illustrator":"さくらんぼ","voiceActor":"麻優莉","forms":[{"id":"uni00417_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[878,1756],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[107,214],"def":[102,204],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","920009"]},{"id":"uni00417_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1356,2712],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[164,328],"def":[154,308],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","920009","920010"]},{"id":"uni00417_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1834,3671],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[221,444],"def":[206,413],"spd":[69,69],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","920009","920010"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Natural damage","tag":"instant"}]},"920009":{"slot":"skill1","id":920009,"name":{"ja":"御手水"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":170,"detail":{"ja":"味方３体の全状態異常を解除する"}},{"level":2,"sp":165,"detail":{"ja":"味方３体の全状態異常を解除する"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"味方３体の全状態異常を解除する"}},{"level":4,"sp":155,"detail":{"ja":"味方３体の全状態異常を解除する"}},{"level":5,"sp":150,"detail":{"ja":"味方３体の全状態異常を解除する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"3 allies with a status ailment: cure all status ailments","tag":"instant"}]},"920010":{"slot":"skill2","id":920010,"name":{"ja":"お清め打ち水"},"hits":3,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、SPDを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 450% Natural damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: SPD -20% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、SPDを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 453% Natural damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: SPD -20% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、SPDを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 457% Natural damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: SPD -20% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、SPDを小ダウンする"},"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 461% Natural damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: SPD -20% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_down","tag":"debuff"}]},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、SPDを小ダウンする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 465% Natural damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"1 enemy: SPD -20% for 4 turns","icon":"spd_down","tag":"debuff"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"巫女のお手伝い"},"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ユニットの使用スキルによるHP回復効果が極小アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Natural allies: skill HP healing +3%","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"points":2,"gold":1,"status":1,"bonus":1,"items":[[1,"blo00001",160],[1,"blo00004",1],[2,"blo00007",15],[3,"blo00010",15],[4,"blo00013",15],[5,"blo00007",15],[6,"blo00010",15],[7,"blo00013",15],[8,"blo00007",15],[9,"blo00010",10],[9,"blo00011",10],[10,"blo00007",10],[10,"blo00008",10],[11,"blo00013",10],[11,"blo00014",10],[12,"blo00001",320],[12,"blo00004",2],[13,"blo00007",10],[13,"blo00008",10],[14,"blo00010",10],[14,"blo00011",10],[15,"blo00013",10],[15,"blo00014",10],[16,"blo00007",10],[16,"blo00008",10],[17,"blo00010",10],[17,"blo00011",10],[18,"blo00013",10],[18,"blo00014",10],[19,"blo00007",10],[19,"blo00008",10],[20,"blo00010",5],[20,"blo00011",15],[20,"blo00012",5],[21,"blo00007",5],[21,"blo00008",15],[21,"blo00009",5],[22,"blo00013",5],[22,"blo00014",15],[22,"blo00015",5],[23,"blo00010",5],[23,"blo00011",15],[23,"blo00012",5],[24,"blo00007",5],[24,"blo00008",15],[24,"blo00009",5],[25,"blo00013",5],[25,"blo00014",15],[25,"blo00015",5],[26,"blo00001",320],[26,"blo00004",1],[27,"blo00007",5],[27,"blo00010",5],[27,"blo00013",5],[28,"blo00007",5],[28,"blo00010",5],[28,"blo00013",5],[29,"blo00007",5],[29,"blo00010",5],[29,"blo00013",5],[30,"blo00007",5],[30,"blo00010",5],[30,"blo00013",5],[31,"blo00001",320],[31,"blo00004",2],[32,"blo00007",5],[32,"blo00010",5],[32,"blo00013",5],[33,"blo00007",5],[33,"blo00010",5],[33,"blo00013",5],[34,"blo00007",5],[34,"blo00010",5],[34,"blo00013",5],[35,"blo00007",5],[35,"blo00010",5],[35,"blo00013",5],[36,"blo00001",320],[36,"blo00004",2],[37,"blo00007",5],[37,"blo00010",5],[37,"blo00013",5],[38,"blo00007",5],[38,"blo00010",5],[38,"blo00013",5],[39,"blo00007",5],[39,"blo00010",5],[39,"blo00013",5],[40,"blo00007",5],[40,"blo00010",5],[40,"blo00013",5],[41,"blo00001",640],[41,"blo00004",2],[42,"blo00007",5],[42,"blo00010",5],[42,"blo00013",5],[43,"blo00007",5],[43,"blo00010",5],[43,"blo00013",5],[44,"blo00007",5],[44,"blo00010",5],[44,"blo00013",5],[45,"blo00007",5],[45,"blo00010",5],[45,"blo00013",5],[46,"blo00001",640],[46,"blo00004",2],[47,"blo00007",5],[47,"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00010",5],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00013",5],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00007",5],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00010",5],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00013",5],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00007",5],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00010",5],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00013",5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ようこそお参りくださいました～……って、ふうま君！？　ちょっ、やだっ、どうして――ひゃわわわっ、恥ずかしい～～～","en":"Welcome... um, Fuuma! What are you doing here? Ahh, this is so embarrassing..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"わっ、わわっ、どうしてここに――私は友達に頼まれて、アルバイトで……って、そんなことより見ないでぇ～！","en":"What are you doing here? I was asked by a friend to help out with the New Year's shrine duties... don't look, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"どうしたの、そんな目で見て……えっ？　可愛い巫女のアルバイトがいるって聞いてきた……？　か、かかっ、可愛いとか言わないでぇっ！","en":"What's with that look? Did you hear there's a cute shrine maiden doing part-time work here? Don't say I'm cute, okay?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"はぁ、またやっちゃった……ごめんね、熱くなかった？　恥ずかしいのにも、早く慣れないといけないんだけど……","en":"Oh no, I did it again... sorry if it was too hot. I need to get used to this, but it's so embarrassing..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"人がいっぱい来る場所なら、少しは視線にも慣れると思ったのに……うぅ～、ふうま君まで来るなんて、聞いてないってばぁ……","en":"I thought I'd get used to the attention if I worked in a crowded place... but with Fuuma here, it's just too much..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"お手水で頭冷やさないとっ……あぁ～、だめだぁ～！　全部、水蒸気になっちゃうよぉっ……","en":"I need to cool my head down with some water... no, it's no use - it'll just turn into steam..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"人に見られても平常心、平常心で――って、やっぱり無理ぃ～～～～っ！","en":"I need to stay calm, stay calm... but it's just no use..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"はぁっ、どうしてこうなっちゃうんだろ……見られるのって、やっぱり慣れないなぁ……","en":"Why does this always happen to me? I guess I'll never get used to being looked at..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ふ、ふうま君、あの……あの、ね？　よかったら、また……その、恥ずかしいの治す訓練、付き合ってくれないかなぁ……？","en":"Fuuma, um, would you... maybe help me with my training to overcome my embarrassment?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00417_1_hom_r18_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"r18","index":2,"text":{"ja":"ふうま君と二人っきりなら、ちょっとだけ大丈夫だから……その、だから……私の、恥ずかしいところ……いっぱい、見てくださいっ……","en":"If it's just the two of us, I might be okay... so, please, look at my embarrassing side..."},"clip":"Audio/Voice_r18/uni00417_1_hom_r18_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00417_1/uni00417_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[50],"scenes":[["chr_0290_r18"]],"stills":[["chr_0290a_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"gacha","type":"Limited","title":{"ja":"【復刻】期間限定正月ガチャ","en":"Rerun: Limited-Time New Year Gacha"},"start":"2025-12-31","end":"2026-01-16","pull":["Pick-up select"]},{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":30,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":true,"origin":"New Year","art":{"graphicId":"uni_00417","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"u